## Installation

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/<repo-name>.git
cd <repo-name>
```

### Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install ollama
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Install Ollama Models

```bash
ollama pull nomic-embed-text
ollama pull llama3.2
```

---

## Run

Start the backend:

```bash
python app.py
```

Open your browser:

```
http://localhost:8080
```

---

## Dependencies

- Python 3.10+
- Flask
- NumPy
- Requests
- Ollama

